  <info>
  <link type="guide" xref="reports#other"/>
  <desc>One window with a button for each report.</desc>
    <credit type="author">
      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Main report window</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Main report window</gui></guiseq> gathers
  the reports as buttons, grouped into <gui>Customers</gui>,
  <gui>Vendors</gui>, <gui>Products</gui>, <gui>Financial</gui>,
  <gui>Other</gui> and <gui>Accounting</gui>. Each opens the same window as its
  menu item; see <link xref="reports"/>.</p>

  <note><p><gui>Product transactions</gui> and <gui>Inventory history</gui>
  do not work from here yet. Use <guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Products</gui>
  <gui>Inventory history</gui></guiseq> instead.</p></note>

</page>
